# Privacy Policy — ReceiptKeep

_Last updated: November 2026_

ReceiptKeep (“the App”) is provided by **Bobé Media** (“we”, “us”, “our”). ReceiptKeep is built so that your receipts stay yours. This policy explains what the App stores, what leaves your device, and why.

## Your Receipts

Your receipts, photos, tags, notes and reimbursement status are stored on your device and in your personal iCloud account, using Apple CloudKit. We have no access to your iCloud data and run no server that stores your receipts.

Backups you export are files you control. We never see them.

## AI Scanning

When you scan a receipt, the text on it is read on your device using Apple's on-device text recognition. The photo never leaves your phone.

If you turn on AI scanning, the recognized text (not the photo) is sent to our server, hosted by **Supabase**, and from there to **Anthropic**, which turns the text into structured fields such as store, total, tax and date. The result is returned to your device and the text is discarded. Neither our server nor Anthropic stores the receipt text, and Anthropic does not use it to train its models.

AI scanning is optional. You are asked before the first AI scan and can turn it off at any time in Account. With it off, scanning works entirely on your device.

## What Our Server Keeps

To limit how many AI scans each account can use, our server stores a one-way hash of your Apple sign-in identifier together with a count of scans per day. The hash cannot be turned back into your identifier, and no receipt data is kept with it. A sign-in session token is held on your device, in the iOS Keychain, so you are not asked to sign in again for 90 days.

## Sign in with Apple

ReceiptKeep uses Sign in with Apple. We receive the identifier Apple assigns to you for this App and, only if you choose to share it, your name and email. We use the identifier to attach your subscription to your account and to apply the scan limits above.

## Purchases

Subscriptions are handled by Apple and **RevenueCat**. RevenueCat receives your app-specific identifier and purchase information from Apple so that your Pro access works across your devices. See RevenueCat's privacy policy at https://www.revenuecat.com/privacy.

## What We Don't Do

We do not sell your data, show ads, or use third-party analytics or tracking. We do not have access to your receipts.

## Deleting Your Data

Delete All Data in Account removes your receipts from your device and from your iCloud account on all your devices. To delete your sign-in record and subscription identifier as well, email us at the address below.

## Children

ReceiptKeep is not directed at children under 13 and we do not knowingly collect information from them.

